      "writtenOn": "2020-12-31T12:01:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Sam, this is my thought for b/155517411 #33 \"3) We could replace some task_wake calls for PD task with a way to ask the state machines if they have more work to do, and use that in pd_task_loop to choose 0 or 5ms wait.\"",
      "revId": "a40791c8cb8622df2e8eb8d49fb4c816bce80b0d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
