        "id": 1149894
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-07T16:43:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I guess either way is fine but I lean more towards your latter comment. Overall, I think this will improve things. I\u0027ll +1 and let Diana be the final arbiter.",
      "parentUuid": "9129e174_ca7559fe",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 93,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 94,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "a40791c8cb8622df2e8eb8d49fb4c816bce80b0d",
